{"id":"en_healing-hands-crushing-fists","title":"Healing Hands, Crushing Fists","titleEn":"Healing Hands, Crushing Fists","description":"Wu Lei, a top martial artist, enters the Gao family through marriage hoping for a quiet existence. That hope shatters when he discovers Gao Lili, his wife, in an affair with a wealthy heir. At that point he drops his cover, disclosing that he is in fact Qin Youlei, a CEO and a martial arts legend. Later, when villains poison Ying Qingxue, Wu Lei puts his own life on the line to rescue her, and the two ultimately become a couple.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/healing-hands-crushing-fists/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/healing-hands-crushing-fists/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Friends to Lovers","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_healing-hands-crushing-fists_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_healing-hands-crushing-fists_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_healing-hands-crushing-fists_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_healing-hands-crushing-fists_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_healing-